   "body": "**Operator decision (2026-11-16, device screenshot of a category's topic list, « Apple »): this settles this issue's open question.**\n\nThe **pushed screens adopt the pill too**, starting with a category's topic list: its title « Apple » sits today inline in the top band between ‹ and the « + » / refresh buttons. It shows in the same centred glass pill as the main screens, for a uniform look.\n\nScope now:\n- the main screens (#977's large title collapsing into the pill);\n- the pushed list screens (a category or sub-forum topic list, the search results), with the pill from the start, since they have no large title;\n- the reader: propose in the PR with screenshots (its title is the topic's, often long, truncated with « … »).\n\nSame rules: one line, « … » truncation, the width from the free space, never over the buttons, VoiceOver header.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
