   "body": "**Operator (2026-11-16): tap on a truncated pill.**\n\n- **Tap:** the pill expands to show the full title on 2 or 3 lines. It folds back on the next tap, on scroll, or after about 4 s.\n- **Long press:** copies the title (« Copié » confirmation, VoiceOver announcement).\n- The scroll-to-top gesture is the system tap at the **top of the screen** (status bar), which is independent of the title: keep it working, with a test or a device check.\n- **Reader:** check legacy @ 87fe0d1c for an existing action on a tap on the topic title. If one exists, it wins, and the full title moves to the long press (copy stays available from a menu). Say what you found in the PR.\n- Test: a long title is truncated in the pill, then expanded after a tap.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
