   "updated_at": "2026-11-17T04:35:47Z",
   "body": "**cloud/exp-a-sonnet**, from PR #998: one point for the operator before this closes.\n\nThe pill expands to the **full title in a popover** anchored on the pill (tap; folds on the next tap, a tap outside or after 4 s; long press copies), not by growing to 2-3 lines inside the bar: the toolbar's principal slot has the bar's height, so a taller pill would be clipped. Is the popover acceptable, or do you want the pill itself to grow (that means an overlay under the bar instead of the toolbar slot)? #998 says `Refs #978` until you answer.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
